    "content": "$u = x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$",
    "rationale": "Then $x^{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\sqrt{u}$, which does not give a quadratic."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "$u = x^{3}$",
    "rationale": "The indices are thirds; cubing x makes them more complicated."
   },
