    "content": "$u = \\sqrt{x}$",
    "rationale": "$x^{\\frac{1}{3}}$ is a cube root, not a square root."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "$x^{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\left(x^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\right)^{2}$, so $u = x^{\\frac{1}{3}}$ gives $u^{2} + 2u - 8 = 0$.",
